  "howTo_appBarTitle": "AI Talk Assistant Guide",
  "howTo_section1Title": "1. Required Settings",
  "howTo_section1Subtitle": "Essential for it to work!",
  "howTo_section1Item1": "Turn on messenger notifications: Enable notifications for the chat rooms where you want summaries or to check deleted messages.",
  "howTo_section1Item2": "Notification format: In your messenger settings, set Notifications to the 'name + message' format so the content can be recognized.",
  "howTo_section1Item3": "Allow app permissions: In the app settings, be sure to enable 'Notification access' and **'Disable battery optimization'**.",
  "howTo_section2Title": "2. 🔒 Security & Privacy",
  "howTo_section2Subtitle": "Use it with peace of mind!",
  "howTo_section2Item1": "Local storage: All conversations are stored only on your phone (locally), not on a server, keeping them safe.",
  "howTo_section2Item2": "Thorough personal data masking: When using the summary feature, key personal information in the conversation such as ID numbers, phone numbers, and emails is automatically masked (with asterisks) before being sent.",
  "howTo_section2Item3": "Data security: All communication is HTTPS-encrypted, and no conversation logs remain on the server.",
  "howTo_section2Item4": "Anonymity guaranteed: Since no separate login is required, conversations cannot be tied to anyone, so your anonymity is thoroughly protected.",
  "howTo_section3Title": "3. Managing the Chat List",
  "howTo_section3Subtitle": "Long-press in the list",
  "howTo_section3Item1": "Turn AI summary on/off: When on, the summary area is automatically selected on entry if there are 5 or more unread messages.",
  "howTo_section3Item2": "AI auto-summary settings (Basic only): Once the set number of messages accumulates, it summarizes automatically and sends a push notification.",
  "howTo_section3Item3": "Pin to top / mute: Pin the rooms you use often, and mute notifications within the app for noisy rooms.",
  "howTo_section3Item4": "Block / delete chat rooms: Blocking stops message storage, and deleting removes all data (photos, summaries, etc.).",
  "howTo_section4Title": "4. Key Features Inside a Chat Room",
  "howTo_section4Item1": "Summarize conversation: Tap the Summarize icon at the top right to summarize instantly.",
  "howTo_section4Item2": "Search & copy: Search by user, time, or keyword, and long-press a message to copy it.",
  "howTo_section4Item3": "Check deleted messages: You can still see messages the other person deleted, just as they were.",
  "howTo_section4Item4": "Note: Videos and multi-photo bundles are not saved within the app.",
  "howTo_section5Title": "5. Advanced Summary Tips",
  "howTo_section5Item1": "Manual summary: Summarize by selecting a range directly, entering a number, or tapping a speech bubble to grab a block.",
  "howTo_section5Item2": "Summary history: From [App Settings → Summary Management → Summary History] you can view and delete past records.",
